{"reviews":[{"id":"B0B6ZM9XJN-0","r":5.0,"t":"Pricey but Worth It","x":"At one point in time could purchase this item at about half the price but when you find a good product that works and is best, the price increase is taken out of the equation. This hairspray holds but does not make the hair stiff. Even on windy days when hair becomes tousled, it can easily be put back in place without adding stiff on top of stiff because there is no stiff! :-)","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B0B6ZM9XJN-1","r":4.0,"t":"Former Dove Customers","x":"If you are looking for a replacement for dove compressed mist flexible hold hairspray you should try this! Since dove has apparently discontinued their hair sprays and the cost of what\u2019s left is astronomical I have been trying multiple brands of other hair sprays. This one comes the closest to what I\u2019ve been looking for it. It\u2019s light weight and doesn\u2019t leave you feeling like you have helmet head. If you are like me, and looking for a replacement you really should try this!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"},{"id":"B0B6ZM9XJN-2","r":5.0,"t":"Wonderful product","x":"I started using this product because nobody was selling L'Oreal creation lift spray. I needed a lightweight hold at a low price. I tried the hold 4 and liked it and wanted a little bit lighter hold so tried this hold 3. It's exactly what I needed to blow dry and style. The price is perfect too. Definitely recommend this microspray...it works well and a great value.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B0B6ZM9XJN-3","r":5.0,"t":"Love this hair spray","x":"This is the second time I have purchased this hairspray. My hair is very fine and without the hair spray, it will fall into my eyes. Hair clips don't work because my hair is too fine. They just fall out. Since I started using this hairspray, I have not had any problems with hair in my eyes. Also, it seems to add some shine to my hair.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B0B6ZM9XJN-4","r":5.0,"t":"Doesn't build up like others","x":"I love the fine mist! I have a lot of problems with static in my hair. I bought this to keep my hair away from my face hoping it would NOT leave a heavy build up. It works exactly how I'd hoped it would!! I definitely recommend this product for a great hold while not causing a heavy build up!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B0B6ZM9XJN-5","r":5.0,"t":"Great non sticky hairspray","x":"I can't find this product in my local stores and I'm so happy to have found it available online. It's my favorite hairspray because it holds but doesn't \"glue\" my hair together","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B0B6ZM9XJN-6","r":3.0,"t":"Wish I didn't have to buy three at once.","x":"I have used the product for years.  Grocery markets often do not have all the items I need because of Covid.  I really didn't need three cans of spray.....but had no choice.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B0B6ZM9XJN-7","r":5.0,"t":"Love it.","x":"I use it all the time and it\u2019s so good against humidity.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B0B6ZM9XJN-8","r":5.0,"t":"I love this product!","x":"I love this product because it holds well in my humid location but is lightweight on my fine hair. I can no longer find it in stores so very happy I have been able to purchase here the past several years.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2022"},{"id":"B0B6ZM9XJN-9","r":5.0,"t":"Touchable hold","x":"Great hairspray that lasts all day without being stiff.  Love the smaller can with the same amount of spray.  I don't feel that I am wasting spray.","h":2,"v":0,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B0B6ZM9XJN-10","r":1.0,"t":"No Go","x":"My hair is a bit fine so I ordered hold level 3.  It didn\u2019t keep my hair in place and it smelled terrible. Total waste of money.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B0B6ZM9XJN-11","r":5.0,"t":"Hairspray","x":"Love this hairspray. Lightweight and doesn\u2019t make my hair feel sticky.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B0B6ZM9XJN-12","r":1.0,"t":"worst hairspray ever","x":"This spray does nothing.  In fact, I actually think it makes my hair look flat in addition to not holding the style.  It is so bad, I am throwing it away.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B0B6ZM9XJN-13","r":5.0,"t":"Great hairspray!","x":"I like this the best of all the hairsprays I have ever used.  It doesn\u2019t make my hair stiff, but holds the style and minimizes \u201cfly away\u201d hair.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B0B6ZM9XJN-14","r":5.0,"t":"Micro mist hair spray","x":"I use Tresemme Compressed Micro Mist Boost hair spray because it is light weight and helps keep my hair in place and not leaving my hair stiff.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"},{"id":"B0B6ZM9XJN-15","r":5.0,"t":"My favorite hairspray","x":"Doesn't feel sticky or heavy.  Doesn't have a strong scent.  The shape of can makes it so much easier to hold for arthritic fingers/hands.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2022"},{"id":"B0B6ZM9XJN-16","r":4.0,"t":"Nice to use","x":"Pretty good hair spray or micro mist. Hold hair nicely but not stiffly. Doesn't last all day and has a strong smell but is nice to use.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B0B6ZM9XJN-17","r":5.0,"t":"Light hair spray","x":"I really like this hair spray as it doesn\u2019t make my hair stiff. It is lightweight. I also don\u2019t have to use a lot. Highly recommend.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B0B6ZM9XJN-18","r":5.0,"t":"Tresemme compressed micro mist boost level 3 hairspray","x":"Liked this product and unfortunately no longer sold in stores...purchased on line from Amazon..great price..","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2022"},{"id":"B0B6ZM9XJN-19","r":5.0,"t":"the hold","x":"My hair is wispy and fine.  This product holds it nicely without being at all heavy or sticky.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B0B6ZM9XJN-20","r":5.0,"t":"Best fine spray hairspray","x":"The fine spray of this product and it does not build up on your hair or cause any stickiness.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B0B6ZM9XJN-21","r":5.0,"t":"Great hairspray","x":"Love this hairspray. Light weight hold. Best I\u2019ve ever used.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2022"},{"id":"B0B6ZM9XJN-22","r":5.0,"t":"goes on lite","x":"Best spray I have ever used don't get sticky, easy to bruch","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B0B6ZM9XJN-23","r":5.0,"t":"Each can was shipped in a separate box. Ridiculous waste.","x":"Each can was shipped separately. Why? Ridiculous waste.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B0B6ZM9XJN-24","r":5.0,"t":"More spray in this can as regular hair spray.","x":"I love the way the mist hair spray covers your style","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2022"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the hairspray for holding styles without making hair stiff or sticky.","cites":[1,6,10,12,14,15]},{"text":"Many customers describe the product as lightweight and effective on fine hair.","cites":[3,9,12,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers value its performance in humidity and against static or flyaways.","cites":[5,8,9,14]},{"text":"Some customers note the price has increased or is high, though many still consider it worth it or reasonably priced.","cites":[1,2,3]},{"text":"A few reviewers report poor hold or an unpleasant smell, with some calling it a waste of money.","cites":[11,13]}]},"qa":[]}